# Scheduled jobs, run by supercronic in the cron service (compose.yaml). Times are UTC.
# A job still running when its next time comes is skipped, not doubled. Syncs pick up from
# their last success, so a run missed while the server was down is covered by the next one.

# After the US close: market bars, actions, filings, FRED, metrics, watchlist (sync-daily)
30 23 * * 1-5 nice -n 10 fin-intel sync-daily
# Security lists, fundamentals, 13F, CFTC, events, prune-raw (sync-weekly)
0 6 * * 0 nice -n 10 fin-intel sync-weekly
# Irreplaceable tables and new raw files to the rclone remote
0 4 * * * nice -n 15 /app/deploy/backup.sh
